{
  "title": "The Capital’s One-Man Army Golem Master—Unexpectedly Banished!? ~Now That I’m Free, I’ll Create the Ultimate Golem Together With My Beautiful Hero Disciples. I Don’t Care Even if They Beg Me to Come Back~",
  "description": "Horace, man who was singlehandedly handling the Diamante Kingdom's operations by using a countless number of machine puppets called [Golems] remotely by using his skill that goes beyond comprehension, was dismissed from his work thanks to an ignorant noble.\n\nHe set out on a leisurely journey to search for ore to aid his research, but... the beautiful hero (disciple) who admired him wouldn't let him be!! She had already made preparations to build him a home in order to repay him but it was all a ploy to keep him for herself?!\n\nBut not only did the tomboyish female alchemist barge in as well, he also caught the attention of the troublesome eldest son of a marquis...\n\n\"Come at me, I'll settle this with one punch.\"\n\"As expected of my master!!\"\n\nUnwavering like a rock, unleashing a devastating single punch that shows no mercy!\n\nA leisurely travel fantasy about a lazy, brutish young man and his companions!",
  "artist": "Rerux",
  "author": "Azumi Shu",
